msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: src/install.md:45
msgid "`amd64`, `arm64`"
msgstr "`amd64`, `arm64`"

#: src/install.md:46
msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

#: src/install.md:46
msgid "`amd64` (Intel), `arm64` (Apple Silicon)"
msgstr "`amd64` (Intel), `arm64` (Apple Silicon)"

#: src/install.md:47
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: src/install.md:47
msgid "`amd64`"
msgstr "`amd64`"

#: src/install.md:49
msgid "Updating"
msgstr "Posodabljanje"

#: src/install.md:51
msgid ""
"Re-run the install one-liner — it always fetches the version this site is "
"serving. To confirm what you have, `goat --version`."
msgstr ""
"Znova zaženite namestitveno enovrstičnico — vedno pridobi različico, ki jo "
"to mesto postreže. Za potrditev, kaj imate, `goat --version`."

#: src/languages.md:3
msgid ""
"goat speaks your language. Its human-facing text — errors, the `doctor` and "
"`status` readouts, the `--help` screens — is translated into **all 28 NATO-"
"member languages plus Ukrainian**."
msgstr ""
"goat govori vaš jezik. Njegovo besedilo za človeka — napake, izpisi `doctor` "
"in `status`, zasloni `--help` — je prevedeno v **vseh 28 jezikov članic NATA "
"in ukrajinščino**."

#: src/languages.md:5
msgid "Choosing a language"
msgstr "Izbira jezika"

#: src/languages.md:7
msgid "goat picks a language in this order:"
msgstr "goat izbere jezik v tem vrstnem redu:"

#: src/languages.md:9
msgid "the `--lang` flag (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"
msgstr "zastavica `--lang` (`goat --lang fr doctor`),"

#: src/languages.md:10
msgid "the `GOAT_LANG` environment variable (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"
msgstr "okoljska spremenljivka `GOAT_LANG` (`export GOAT_LANG=uk`),"

#: src/languages.md:11
msgid "your operating system's locale,"
msgstr "lokalne nastavitve vašega operacijskega sistema,"

#: src/languages.md:12
msgid "English."
msgstr "angleščina."

#: src/languages.md:15
msgid "# just this command, in German\n"
msgstr "# samo ta ukaz, v nemščini\n"

#: src/languages.md:16
msgid "# everything, in French, for this shell\n"
msgstr "# vse, v francoščini, za to lupino\n"

#: src/languages.md:19
msgid ""
"English is the authoritative source: if a phrase hasn't been translated yet, "
"goat shows the English rather than a blank."
msgstr ""
"Angleščina je merodajni vir: če fraza še ni prevedena, goat prikaže "
"angleščino namesto praznine."

#: src/languages.md:21
msgid "What stays the same in every language"
msgstr "Kaj ostane enako v vsakem jeziku"

#: src/languages.md:23
msgid ""
"The **machine surface never changes**. `--json` field values, error codes "
"(`E_OFF_MESH`, …), exit codes, command and flag names, and contract tokens "
"(paths, keys, URLs) are byte-for-byte identical no matter the language. "
"Translate the prose, not the contract — so your scripts work the same for "
"every operator."
msgstr ""
"**Strojna površina se nikoli ne spremeni.** Vrednosti polj `--json`, kode "
"napak (`E_OFF_MESH`, …), izhodne kode, imena ukazov in zastavic ter žetoni "
"dogovora (poti, ključi, URL-ji) so bajt za bajt enaki ne glede na jezik. "
"Prevedite prozo, ne dogovora — tako da vaši skripti delujejo enako za "
"vsakega operaterja."

#: src/languages.md:25
msgid "A note on machine-translated text"
msgstr "Opomba o strojno prevedenem besedilu"

#: src/languages.md:27
msgid ""
"Most translations are machine-produced and awaiting native-speaker review. "
"When you run goat in one of those languages, it prints a short, one-time "
"notice on standard error telling you the text is machine-translated, that "
"the English is authoritative, and where to report a translation error. "
"Suppress it with `GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."
msgstr ""
"Večina prevodov je strojno ustvarjenih in čaka na pregled rojenega govorca. "
"Ko zaženete goat v enem od teh jezikov, izpiše kratko enkratno obvestilo na "
"standardni napaki, ki vam pove, da je besedilo strojno prevedeno, da je "
"angleščina merodajna in kam prijaviti napako v prevodu. Zatrete ga z "
"`GOAT_I18N_NO_WARN=1`."

#: src/languages.md:29
msgid ""
"If you speak one of these languages and spot something off, that report is "
"genuinely welcome — it's how the catalogs get better."
msgstr ""
"Če govorite enega od teh jezikov in opazite kaj narobe, je takšna prijava "
"resnično dobrodošla — tako se katalogi izboljšujejo."

#: src/languages.md:31
msgid "And one for fun"
msgstr "In eden za zabavo"

#: src/languages.md:33
msgid ""
"`goat --lang tlh` renders the marquee lines in **Klingon**. It's an opt-in "
"easter egg — never selected automatically — and, like every other locale, it "
"can't touch the machine surface. Qapla'."
msgstr ""
"`goat --lang tlh` izriše glavne vrstice v **klingonščini**. Je velikonočno "
"jajce, ki ga je treba izrecno izbrati — nikoli izbrano samodejno — in kot "
"vsaka druga jezikovna nastavitev se ne more dotakniti strojne površine. "
"Qapla'."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:3
msgid "When something's wrong, start with one command:"
msgstr "Ko je nekaj narobe, začnite z enim ukazom:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:9
msgid ""
"It runs four steps in order and, for any that fails, prints a specific fix. "
"Here's how to read it."
msgstr ""
"Po vrsti izvede štiri korake in za vsak, ki ne uspe, izpiše posebno rešitev. "
"Tukaj je, kako to brati."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:11
msgid "Reading `goat doctor`"
msgstr "Branje `goat doctor`"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "Step"
msgstr "Korak"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "What it checks"
msgstr "Kaj preverja"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Če ne uspe"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "**mesh**"
msgstr "**mreža**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're on the fabric's network"
msgstr "Ste v omrežju fabrica"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're off-mesh — bring up your tunnel (`netbird status` / re-enroll)"
msgstr ""
"Niste na mreži — vzpostavite svoj tunel (`netbird status` / ponovno se "
"vpišite)"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "**router**"
msgstr "**usmerjevalnik**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "The fabric's router is reachable"
msgstr "Usmerjevalnik fabrica je dosegljiv"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid ""
"The router may be down, or your endpoint is wrong — re-check your profile"
msgstr ""
"Usmerjevalnik je morda nedosegljiv ali pa je vaša končna točka napačna — "
"znova preverite svoj profil"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "**certificate**"
msgstr "**potrdilo**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "Your identity is accepted"
msgstr "Vaša identiteta je sprejeta"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid ""
"Your cert may be expired or rejected — `goat profile show`, then re-onboard "
"if needed"
msgstr ""
"Vaše potrdilo je morda poteklo ali zavrnjeno — `goat profile show`, nato se "
"po potrebi znova priključite"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "**portal**"
msgstr "**portal**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "Your access token works"
msgstr "Vaš dostopni žeton deluje"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid "Token expired or revoked — ask to be re-onboarded"
msgstr "Žeton je potekel ali bil preklican — prosite za ponovno priključitev"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:20
msgid ""
"Each failed step exits with a distinct code, so a wrapper script can branch "
"without parsing text."
msgstr ""
"Vsak neuspeli korak se konča z lastno kodo, tako da se lahko ovojni skript "
"razveji brez razčlenjevanja besedila."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:22
msgid "Common situations"
msgstr "Pogoste situacije"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:24
msgid ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** You're not on the fabric's "
"network. Bring up your mesh tunnel and try again; `goat doctor` will confirm "
"once you're on."
msgstr ""
"**\"off the ZTOL — not connected to the mesh\"** Niste v omrežju fabrica. "
"Vzpostavite svoj mrežni tunel in poskusite znova; `goat doctor` bo potrdil, "
"ko boste na njej."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:27
msgid ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Your identity is stale. "
"`goat profile show` to see its expiry; if it's past, you'll need a fresh "
"bundle."
msgstr ""
"**\"mTLS cert expired or rejected by the router\"** Vaša identiteta je "
"zastarela. `goat profile show`, da vidite njen potek; če je v preteklosti, "
"boste potrebovali nov sveženj."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:30
msgid ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Your access token is no longer "
"valid (expired or revoked). Ask your administrator to re-onboard you."
msgstr ""
"**\"portal rejected the Bearer token\"** Vaš dostopni žeton ni več veljaven "
"(potekel ali preklican). Prosite svojega administratorja, naj vas znova "
"priključi."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:33
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows a `[✗]`** `status` is the one-glance view; run `goat "
"doctor` for the stepped detail and the specific remedy."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` prikaže `[✗]`** `status` je pogled na prvi pogled; zaženite "
"`goat doctor` za stopenjske podrobnosti in posebno rešitev."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:36
msgid ""
"**`goat status` shows `ztol` green but `session` red** The router port accepts connections, but a Zenoh session does not open: the router is wedged, or it rejects your certificate. A mesh bounce does not fix this. Run `goat doctor` and tell your administrator."
msgstr ""
"**`goat status` kaže `ztol` zeleno, `session` pa rdeče** Vrata usmerjevalnika sprejemajo povezave, vendar se seja Zenoh ne odpre: usmerjevalnik se je zataknil ali zavrača vaše potrdilo. Ponovni zagon povezave mesh tega ne odpravi. Zaženite `goat doctor` in obvestite skrbnika."

#: src/troubleshooting.md:39
msgid "Understanding an error code"
msgstr "Razumevanje kode napake"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:38
msgid "Every error carries a stable code (like `E_OFF_MESH`). To look one up:"
msgstr "Vsaka napaka nosi stabilno kodo (kot `E_OFF_MESH`). Za iskanje:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:44
msgid "Practice without risk"
msgstr "Vadba brez tveganja"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:46
msgid ""
"If you just want to explore commands without touching anything real, the "
"sandbox is always there:"
msgstr ""
"Če želite samo raziskati ukaze, ne da bi se dotaknili česar koli resničnega, "
"je peskovnik vedno na voljo:"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:53
msgid "Still stuck?"
msgstr "Še vedno obtičali?"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:55
msgid ""
"Capture the exact command and its output (use `--json` for a clean, complete "
"record) and bring it to your goat administrator."
msgstr ""
"Zajemite natančen ukaz in njegov izhod (uporabite `--json` za čist, popoln "
"zapis) in ga prinesite svojemu goat administratorju."

#: src/admin.md:3
msgid ""
"`goat admin` is the operator surface: onboarding and revoking participants, "
"rotating certificates, cutting a misbehaving peer off the mesh, provisioning "
"devices, and LAN-side triage. It sits apart from the everyday commands on "
"purpose."
msgstr ""
"`goat admin` je operaterski vmesnik: vključevanje in preklic udeležencev, "
"rotacija certifikatov, izključitev neustreznega enakovrednega vozlišča iz "
"mreže, zagotavljanje naprav in diagnostika na strani LAN. Namerno je ločen "
"od vsakodnevnih ukazov."

#: src/admin.md:5
msgid ""
"**Operator-only.** These commands are for operators who hold admin "
"credentials. If you're a participant publishing and subscribing on the "
"fabric, this chapter isn't your day-to-day — your surface is **[Everyday "
"tasks](everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / `who` / `health`). `goat "
"admin` is **inert for non-admins**: an unauthorized call changes nothing and "
"tells you so."
msgstr ""
"**Samo za operaterje.** Ti ukazi so namenjeni operaterjem z "
"administratorskimi poverilnicami. Če ste udeleženec, ki objavlja in se "
"naroča na tkanini, to poglavje ni vaše vsakodnevno gradivo — vaš vmesnik je "
"**[Vsakodnevne naloge](everyday.md)** (`goat pub` / `sub` / `top` / `who` / "
"`health`). `goat admin` je **za neadministratorje neaktiven**: nepooblaščen "
"klic ne spremeni ničesar in vas o tem obvesti."

#: src/admin.md:7
msgid "What \"operator-only\" means in practice"
msgstr "Kaj „samo za operaterje\" pomeni v praksi"

#: src/admin.md:9
msgid ""
"The authority isn't in the CLI — it's in _your credentials_. `goat` itself "
"is a thin client; whether you may onboard an org or eject a peer is decided "
"by what your operator profile and environment carry, and confirmed by the "
"portal and the NetBird management API. So an admin command can stop in two "
"honest places:"
msgstr ""
"Pooblastilo ni v CLI — je v _vaših poverilnicah_. `goat` je tanek odjemalec; "
"ali smete vključiti organizacijo ali izključiti enakovredno vozlišče, določa "
"vaš operaterski profil in okolje, potrdi pa portal in NetBird management "
"API. Torej se administratorski ukaz lahko ustavi na dveh mestih:"

#: src/admin.md:11
msgid ""
"**Up front, before anything is sent.** If your machine has no operator setup "
"at all — no initialized profile and no operator environment — `goat admin` "
"refuses immediately with `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Nothing leaves your laptop."
msgstr ""
"**Vnaprej, preden je karkoli poslano.** Če vaš stroj nima operaterske "
"nastavitve — brez inicializiranega profila in brez operaterskega okolja — "
"`goat admin` takoj zavrne z `E_NOT_ADMIN`. Nič ne zapusti vašega prenosnika."

#: src/admin.md:12
msgid ""
"**Server-side, at the action.** If you do have credentials but they aren't "
"authorized for this action, the portal or NetBird returns a refusal. A "
"refused _mutation_ means nothing changed — and `goat` reports it as "
"`E_NOT_ADMIN`, not as a vague token error."
msgstr ""
"**Na strežniku, pri dejanju.** Če imate poverilnice, a niso pooblaščene za "
"to dejanje, portal ali NetBird vrne zavrnitev. Zavrnjena _mutacija_ pomeni, "
"da se ni nič spremenilo — in `goat` to sporoči kot `E_NOT_ADMIN`, ne kot "
"nejasen napako žetona."

#: src/admin.md:14
msgid "Two error codes you'll want to tell apart:"
msgstr "Dve kodi napak, ki ju je vredno razlikovati:"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Code"
msgstr "Koda"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Pomen"

#: src/admin.md:16
msgid "What to do"
msgstr "Kaj storiti"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "`E_NOT_ADMIN`"

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Your credential is **valid but not authorized** for this action (or no "
"operator credential is configured)."
msgstr ""
"Vaša poverilnica je **veljavna, a ni pooblaščena** za to dejanje (ali pa "
"operaterska poverilnica ni nastavljena)."

#: src/admin.md:18
msgid ""
"Confirm you're on your operator profile and have sourced your operator "
"environment. If you still can't, this action isn't for your role — contact "
"your goat administrator. Re-onboarding won't change it."
msgstr ""
"Preverite, da ste na operaterskem profilu in da ste naložili operatersko "
"okolje. Če še vedno ne morete, to dejanje ni za vašo vlogo — kontaktirajte "
"svojega goat administratorja. Ponovna vključitev tega ne bo spremenila."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"
msgstr "`E_TOKEN_INVALID`"

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Your credential is **expired or bad** (HTTP 401)."
msgstr "Vaša poverilnica je **potekla ali neveljavna** (HTTP 401)."

#: src/admin.md:19
msgid "Re-onboard to get a fresh token."
msgstr "Ponovno se vključite, da dobite svež žeton."

#: src/admin.md:21
msgid ""
"Reading about admin is never gated: `goat admin --help` and `goat admin "
"<cmd> --help` always work, in every language. Only _running_ an action is "
"checked."
msgstr ""
"Branje o administraciji nikoli ni zaklenjeno: `goat admin --help` in `goat "
"admin <cmd> --help` vedno delujeta, v vsakem jeziku. Preverjeno je le "
"_izvajanje_ dejanja."

#: src/admin.md:23
msgid "The commands"
msgstr "Ukazi"

#: src/admin.md:25
msgid ""
"Add `--help` to any of these for the full flag set, or see the **[Command "
"reference](reference.md)** — the details there are generated from the "
"binary, so they always match what you're running."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte `--help` kateremu koli od teh za celoten nabor zastavic, ali si "
"oglejte **[Referenčni priročnik za ukaze](reference.md)** — podrobnosti tam "
"so generirane iz binarne datoteke, zato se vedno ujemajo s tistim, kar "
"izvajate."

#: src/admin.md:41
msgid "A few notes:"
msgstr "Nekaj opomb:"

#: src/admin.md:43
msgid ""
"**`lan` is the break-glass diagnostic.** `scan` and `doctor` mutate nothing, "
"need no credentials, and are built to work when the mesh and every service "
"are down — so they're the one part of `goat admin` that isn't refused for a "
"missing operator environment."
msgstr ""
"**`lan` je diagnostično orodje za skrajne primere.** `scan` in `doctor` "
"ničesar ne mutirata, ne potrebujeta poverilnic in sta zasnovana za "
"delovanje, ko sta mreža in vsaka storitev nedosegljivi — zato sta edini del "
"`goat admin`, ki ni zavrnjen ob manjkajočem operaterskem okolju."

#: src/admin.md:44
msgid ""
"**`rotate` keeps identity fixed.** It re-issues the leaf certificate for the "
"same anchor, alias, write namespace, and ACL — only the cert and key are "
"new. Use it for renewal or re-keying, not for changing who someone is."
msgstr ""
"**`rotate` ohranja identiteto.** Znova izda listni certifikat za isti "
"sidriščni certifikat, vzdevek, pisalni imenski prostor in ACL — nova sta le "
"certifikat in ključ. Uporabite ga za obnovo ali zamenjavo ključev, ne za "
"spremembo identitete."

#: src/admin.md:45
msgid ""
"**`peer cut` is the real cut.** On the brokerless fabric a certificate is "
"inert without a mesh path, so removing the _peer_ is what stops a flooder — "
"`goat health` finds it, `goat admin peer cut` ejects it."
msgstr ""
"**`peer cut` je resnični rez.** Na tkanini brez posrednika je certifikat "
"brez poti po mreži neaktiven, zato je odstranitev _enakovrednega vozlišča_ "
"tisto, kar ustavi poplavljalca — `goat health` ga najde, `goat admin peer "
"cut` ga izključi."

#: src/admin.md:46
msgid ""
"**Destructive actions confirm first.** `org delete`, `peer cut`, and the `--"
"org` cascades print what they're about to do and ask before acting (`--yes` "
"to skip, `--dry-run` to preview)."
msgstr ""
"**Destruktivna dejanja najprej zahtevajo potrditev.** `org delete`, `peer "
"cut` in kaskade `--org` natisnejo, kaj nameravajo storiti, in preden "
"ukrepajo vprašajo za potrditev (`--yes` za preskok, `--dry-run` za "
"predogled)."

#: src/admin.md:48
msgid "If you see `E_NOT_ADMIN`"
msgstr "Če vidite `E_NOT_ADMIN`"

#: src/admin.md:50
msgid "Nothing was changed. Walk through it:"
msgstr "Nič ni bilo spremenjeno. Preverite po korakih:"

#: src/admin.md:52
msgid ""
"**Are you on your operator profile?** `goat context use <name>` selects it; "
"`goat profile show` confirms which one is active."
msgstr ""
"**Ste na operaterskem profilu?** `goat context use <name>` ga izbere; `goat "
"profile show` potrdi, kateri je aktiven."

#: src/admin.md:53
msgid ""
"**Have you sourced your operator environment?** Admin actions read operator "
"credentials from the environment (for example `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` and the "
"NetBird admin token) — never from the profile on disk."
msgstr ""
"**Ste naložili operatersko okolje?** Administratorska dejanja berejo "
"operaterske poverilnice iz okolja (na primer `GOAT_OPERATOR_HANDLE` in "
"NetBird admin žeton) — nikoli iz profila na disku."

#: src/admin.md:54
msgid ""
"**Should you have this access at all?** If you've checked the above and the "
"portal still refuses, your role isn't authorized for this action. Contact "
"your goat administrator — re-onboarding the same identity won't grant it."
msgstr ""
"**Ali bi sploh morali imeti ta dostop?** Če ste preverili zgornje in portal "
"še vedno zavrača, vaša vloga ni pooblaščena za to dejanje. Kontaktirajte "
"svojega goat administratorja — ponovna vključitev iste identitete tega ne bo "
"omogočila."

#: src/admin.md:56
msgid "The full operator workflow"
msgstr "Celoten operaterski potek dela"

#: src/admin.md:58
msgid ""
"This chapter orients you to the surface and how it behaves. The end-to-end "
"operator workflow — the capability model, setting up your environment and "
"certificates, and the onboard / revoke / rotate / audit loop — lives in the "
"**admin-operator guide** that ships with your goatnet's operations docs, not "
"in this book."
msgstr ""
"To poglavje vas orientira glede vmesnika in njegovega obnašanja. Celoten "
"operaterski potek dela — model zmogljivosti, nastavitev okolja in "
"certifikatov ter zanka vključevanja / preklica / rotacije / revizije — je v "
"**vodniku za admin-operaterje**, ki se dobavi z operativno dokumentacijo "
"vašega goatnet-a, ne v tej knjigi."

