#: src/concepts.md:9
msgid ""
"You join with an **identity**: an onboarding _bundle_ that carries your "
"certificate, an access token, and where the fabric lives. The fabric admits "
"you by _who you are_, not by a shared password. `goat ca add <bundle-"
"ca.pem>` tells goat which CA to trust — it ships trusting none — and `goat "
"profile init <bundle.cbor>` then installs that identity; you can hold "
"several under different _contexts_ and switch between them."
msgstr ""
"Pridružite se z **identiteto**: uvajalnim _paketom_, ki nosi vaše potrdilo, dostopni žeton in kje je tkanina. Tkanina vas sprejme glede na to, _kdo ste_, ne na podlagi skupnega gesla. `goat ca add <bundle-ca.pem>` pove goatu, kateremu CA naj zaupa — dobavljen je brez zaupanja kateremu koli — in `goat profile init <bundle.cbor>` nato namesti to identiteto; imate jih lahko več pod različnimi _konteksti_ in preklapljate med njimi."

#: src/getting-started.md:50
msgid ""
"The first line is not optional. `goat` ships trusting **no** goatnet, so "
"`profile init` refuses until you add the root that signed your bundle — the "
"`-ca.pem` ships beside the `.cbor` it verifies. `goat ca add` prints a "
"fingerprint; check it against one your operator gives you before relying on "
"it, because a bundle that reached you over a channel proves only that the "
"channel delivered it. `goat ca ls` shows what you trust; one binary works "
"against every goatnet whose root you have added."
msgstr ""
"Prva vrstica ni izbirna. `goat` je dobavljen brez zaupanja **kateremu koli** goatnetu, zato `profile init` zavrne, dokler ne dodate korena, ki je podpisal vaš paket — `-ca.pem` je dobavljen ob `.cbor`, ki ga preverja. `goat ca add` izpiše prstni odtis; primerjajte ga s tistim, ki vam ga da operater, preden se nanj zanesete, kajti paket, ki vas je dosegel po kanalu, dokazuje le, da ga je kanal dostavil. `goat ca ls` pokaže, čemu zaupate; en binarni program deluje z vsakim goatnetom, čigar koren ste dodali."
